rface":"公子光","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004819","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m006-0184","start":184,"end":185,"surface":"光","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004819","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-086-cike","book_id":"b-shiji-086","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-086-cike"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:p007","text":"四月丙子，光伏甲士於窟室中，而具酒請王僚。王僚使兵陳自宮至光之家，門戸階陛左右，皆王僚之親戚也。夾立侍，皆持長鈹。酒既酣，公子光詳爲足疾，入窟室中，使專諸置匕首魚炙之腹中而進之。既至王前，專諸擘魚，因以匕首刺王僚，王僚立死。左右亦殺專諸，王人擾亂。公子光出其伏甲以攻王僚之徒，盡滅之，遂自立爲王，是爲闔閭。闔閭乃封專諸之子以爲上卿。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m007-0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"光","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004819","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m007-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"甲士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名氏稱或尚待核定的嵌套親屬指代，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m007-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"王僚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004818","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m007-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"王僚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004818","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m007-0029","start":29,"end":30,"surface":"光","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004819","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m007-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"左右","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名氏稱或尚待核定的嵌套親屬指代，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m007-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"王僚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004818","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m007-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"親戚","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名氏稱或尚待核定的嵌套親屬指代，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m007-0061","start":61,"end":64,"surface":"公子光","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004819","status":"contextu